  "description": "Retrospective rear outrigger extension, installation of Air Source Heat Pump, Flue and solar PV panel mounted to existing mansard dormer and new outrigger roof along with fenestration alterations",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to occupation, at least 1 bird/bat box shall be provided below eaves level at the development hereby approved and thereafter retained.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interests of improvements to biodiversity.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall ensure that the rating level of noise emissions from the ASHP does not exceed 10dB below the background noise level at the nearest residential receptor, in accordance with BS4142:2014+A1:2019.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should any changes to the approved plant or equipment occur, a noise assessment must be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority to demonstrate compliance with BS4142:2014+A1:2019.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To safeguard the amenity of neighbouring occupiers and ensure compliance with Policy LP2 of Hackney’s Local Plan and the London Plan’s strategic noise policies.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The window in the side elevation of the extension at second floor level shall be obscure-glazed and non-openable up to 1.7 metres from floor level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure the proposed development does not detrimentally impact the amenity enjoyed by neighbouring residents.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
